  "_comment": "Authority contacts for seeding. Checked against each body's own site on the verified_at date. Five of the six corporations publish no complaint address at all - they run a portal and a helpline - and their null email is deliberate, not missing data. Commissioners' addresses are published but excluded on purpose: an executive desk receiving automated pothole letters is how a sending domain earns a spam reputation. The mcgm.gov.in addresses come from a July 2019 department directory and want a test message before a resident's complaint is sent to one.",
